ulection-radio-show-519.jpg","content":"Vol. 3 - Joe goes through the classic beat era of 2008-2017.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-08-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"slx7l6sr74w","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"dom$olo - DebbieDowner :/","track":{"id":"wOOaFjee4CM","path":"/artists/dom-olo/tracks/debbiedowner/","slug":"debbiedowner","title":"DebbieDowner :/","artist":{"slug":"domolo","title":"dom$olo"},"artwork":"images/artists/dom-olo/tracks/debbiedowner.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-139-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"NqfzIeYk-iE","position":93,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"dom$olo - BrownShugaPackets","track":{"id":"ahX2WnZ5np4","path":"/artists/domsolo/tracks/brownshugapackets/","slug":"brownshugapackets","title":"BrownShugaPackets","artist":{"slug":"domolo","title":"dom$olo"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"dNMGj9vkG6w","position":82,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"dom$olo - BrownShugaPackets","track":{"id":"ahX2WnZ5np4","path":"/artists/domsolo/tracks/brownshugapackets/","slug":"brownshugapackets","title":"BrownShugaPackets","artist":{"slug":"domolo","title":"dom$olo"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"qhoWM8jii84","position":56,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"dom$olo - BrownShugaPackets","track":{"id":"ahX2WnZ5np4","path":"/artists/domsolo/tracks/brownshugapackets/","slug":"brownshugapackets","title":"BrownShugaPackets","artist":{"slug":"domolo","title":"dom$olo"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"nbke6-Mfddk","slug":"161","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-161"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #161","artwork":"/images/episodes/161.jpg","content":"Joe focuses on new tracks from forthcoming Soulection releases.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe also announced some hints about what to expect in the coming months. We have so much in store for you. \nWe're only a couple of weeks in to the new year and already we feel like we have hit some milestones. \n\nStay tuned. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10868,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Ft9cSN_hGMY","position":22,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"dom$olo - DebbieDowner :/","track":{"id":"wOOaFjee4CM","path":"/artists/dom-olo/tracks/debbiedowner/","slug":"debbiedowner","title":"DebbieDowner :/","artist":{"slug":"domolo","title":"dom$olo"},"artwork":"images/artists/dom-olo/tracks/debbiedowner.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","